Package: nepva
Type: Package
Title: Population Viability Analysis for Seabird Populations
Version: 4.18
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andrew", "Harwood", role = "cre",
           email = "Andrew.Harwood@naturalengland.org.uk"),
    person("Natural England", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Functions for population viability analysis (PVA) of seabird
    populations using Leslie matrix models. Supports demographic and
    environmental stochasticity, impact and mitigation scenarios, validation
    against historical counts, and local and global sensitivity analyses.
    Underpins the Natural England and JNCC seabird PVA Shiny tool.
License: MIT
URL: https://github.com/dmpstats/nepva
BugReports: https://github.com/dmpstats/nepva/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
